@InventoryApi = https://localhost:7240

### 1. Obtain an antiforgery token and keep the response cookie.
GET {{InventoryApi}}/api/v1/auth/csrf
Accept: application/json

### 2. Login. Replace both the token and credentials.
POST {{InventoryApi}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "admin@example.invalid",
  "password": "replace-with-a-secret",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### 3. Read the authenticated principal.
GET {{InventoryApi}}/api/v1/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### 4. List assets.
GET {{InventoryApi}}/api/v1/assets?page=1&pageSize=50&sort=assetTag
Accept: application/json
